; at Junior Accommodation</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Ready to install Local DB panel at Clinic</p><p>-Status 100 %</p><p><br></p><p><u>Denyo DG01&nbsp; (200KW)&nbsp; at Catering &amp; Laundry&nbsp;</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Arrange power cable lay down from generator to electrical room&nbsp;</p><p>-Need to press cable lug for looping cable</p><p>-Status 70 %</p></div>', NULL, '2024-12-19 18:14:21', '2024-12-19 18:25:55', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
