<p><br></p><p><u>Rental Gen 1 (200KW)</u></p><p>-Cable arrangement from G-8930 to G-8925</p><p>-At that time G-8925 is on duty.</p><p>-Start the generator G-8930&nbsp;</p><p>-Duty transfer G-8925 to G-8930</p><p>-G-8930 is on duty, G8925 is standby</p><p>-Install cable lug for one power cable (120SQMM)</p><p>--Status 60 %</p><p><br></p><p><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">18.12.24 Activity</u></p><p>Power Cable installation diesel generator for FSD</p><div><u><br></u></div><div><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</u></div><div><p><br></p><p><u>Rental Gen 2 (135KW) at HVAC Unit</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Ready to install HVAC Panel&nbsp;</p><p>-Status 90 %</p><p><br></p><p><u>YDN Gen 2 (8.4KW)&nbsp; at Water Treatment Unit</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Ready to install&nbsp; UCP 8825 water treatment unit panel</p><p>-Status 100 %</p><p><br></p><p><u>Rental Gen 3&nbsp; (30KW)&nbsp; at Junior Accommodation</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Ready to install ACDB8102 panel</p><p>-Status 100 %</p><p><br></p><p><u>YDN Gen 3&nbsp; (5KW)&nbsp; at Junior Accommodation</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Ready to install Local DB panel at Clinic</p><p>-Status 100 %</p><p><br></p><p><u>Denyo DG01&nbsp; (200KW)&nbsp; at Catering &amp; Laundry&nbsp;</u></p><p>-Install cable lug power cable&nbsp;</p><p>-Termination on Generator side</p><p>-Arrange power cable lay down from generator to electrical room&nbsp;</p><p>-Need to press cable lug for looping cable</p><p>-Status 70 %</p></div>', NULL, '2024-12-20 18:05:35', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', NULL, false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
