bsp; &nbsp; Cannot Communicate&nbsp;</div><div>25%&nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; Cannot Communicate</div><div>50%&nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Not Open</div><div>75%&nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; 13% Open</div><div>100%-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 37.3 Open</div><div><br></div><div>By HART</div><div><br></div><div><div>0%&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; 0.8%</div><div>25%&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; 25.2%</div><div>50%&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; 50.2%</div><div>75%&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; 75.2%</div><div>100%&nbsp; -&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;99.1%</div></div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><u>28.1.25 Activity</u></div><div><u><br></u></div><div><div>Verify and troubleshoot PCV 81202B&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><u>Action</u> <br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></div><div><u><br></u></div><div>-Perform PCV 81202 B</div><div>-Communicate with control room to open the valve 100%, 75 , 50, 25, o%</div><div>-Control give the command to open but can''t open 100% , just open 40 %</div><div>-connect with Hart.</div><div>-Check the status</div><div>-pressure can''t maintain and release the pressure</div><div>-Need to check and troubleshoot tomorrow.&nbsp;</div></div>', NULL, '2025-01-30 18:02:18', '2025-01-30 18:10:58', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
