t as follow;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Choke valves tag no. HV-01C1 to&nbsp; HV-01V1.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- HV-01A1, B1, D1, N1 The actuator have been removed and hydraulic supply disconnected.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Production ON/OFF valves tag no. XV-01G4, H4, K4, L4, Q4, T4.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01C4, F4 Can not stroke test due to manual type.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01M4, P4, R4, V4 Can not stroke test due to manual lock closed.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01A4, B4, D4, N4, U4 Out of service well.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Test separator ON/OFF valves tag no. XV-01C5 to XV-01V5&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01A5, B5, D5, N5, U5 Out of service well.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Booster comp. ON/OFF Valves tag no. XV-01C6, F6, M6, P6, R6, V6.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01G6, H6, K6, L6, Q6, T6 Can not stroke test due to BC running.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- XV-01A6, B6, D6, N6, U6 Out of service well.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;+ Downhole pressure switches tag no. PSL-01C1 to PSL-01V1.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- PSL-01A1, B1, D1, N1, U1 Out of service well.</p><div><br></div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2025-02-01 11:49:31', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
