ed seal kit of the actuator and then function test completed.</div></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2025-02-01 11:55:32', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
