t tomorrow.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - HV-1NN1 new SMAR transmitter replacement tomorrow.</p><p><br></p><p>23-Jan-25</p><p>Continue maintenance and inspection as follow;</p><p>&nbsp;1. Check all external condition no damage.</p><p>&nbsp;2. Check the cable and labelled and cables tag number are legible.</p><p>&nbsp;3. Check all wiring connections and re-tightening.</p><p>&nbsp;4. Check all tube connectors for leak and tightening.</p><p>&nbsp;5. Function test equipment as follow;</p><p>&nbsp; + F/L temperature tag no.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - TT-1NA2 transmitter has been removed.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - TT-1NB2 fail reading (out of service wellhead. No correction needed).</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - TT-1NQ2 replaced new transmitter and function test completed.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; + DHV Pressure switch low; PSL-1NA1 to PSL-1NR1</p><p>&nbsp; + Choke valve tag no.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - HV-1NB1 out of servic wellhead. No correction needed.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - HV-1NN1 replaced new speed adjuster on Solenoid ''B''.</p><p>&nbsp; + Production branch valves; XV-09A4 to XV-09R4.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - XV-1NA4 out of service (Isolated Gas supply and Removed actuator)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - XV-1NB4 out of service (Isolated Gas supply and Removed actuator)&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; + Test separation branch valves; XV-09A5 to XV-09R5.</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - XV-1NA5 out of service (Isolated Gas supply)</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; - XV-1NB5 out of service (Isolated Gas supply)</p><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2025-02-01 12:49:01', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
