/p><p><br></p><p><u>5.2.2025 activity</u></p><p>Reconnect wire back to control card at DG03</p><p><u><br></u></p><p><u>Action</u></p><p>-Perform cable lug these two wire AC2 and F1&nbsp;</p><p>-Reconnect wire back to control card at DG03</p><p>-Modified speed sensor cover&nbsp;</p><p>-Reconnect speed sensor cable</p><p>-we will test run tomorrow&nbsp;</p></div></div>', NULL, '2025-02-05 17:51:00', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', NULL, false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
