Installed digital pressure gauge at downstream GCV to monitor.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">2) Adjusted downstream PCV fuel gas pressure up to 8 Kpa.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">3) Inspected breather cartridges in both bank-A and B.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">4) Refitted ignition coil wire connection in both bank-A and B.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">5) Inspected and cleaned air filters.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History (26.02.2025)</u></b></p><p><b><u style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Today Activity</u></b></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">G8920 battery charging &amp; speed sensor replacement</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></p><p><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Perform work permit and tool box talk.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Charge the battery bank1 at battery room.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Install back to test run after magnetic pick up installation done.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Replace with new over speed sensor (60.07.79.001.9).</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Test run G8920 with battery charger.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Can''t start the engine. Stuck at starting state.</span></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '2025-02-28 18:52:28', '2025-03-01 07:02:54', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Se-EI', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
