nt of concern, Pre-assembly of the solenoid valves must be well prepared before the execution.</div><div>&nbsp; - The Mounting panel must be removed to make holes in the Workshop due to the plate too tough for drilling by the portable driller.</div><div>&nbsp; - Well-site mounting and rectification should be reviewed in the installation scene.</div>', NULL, '2025-03-03 13:31:36', '2025-03-03 16:51:49', 'PTTEP\\Arthit.EI-Turbine', 'PTTEP\\Arthit.EI-Turbine', false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
