3, 164 and 165.</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;5. De-isolate and Boost charging current after discharge =39.0 Amps.</div><div>&nbsp;6. De-isolate and Boost charging voltage after discharge = 394.5 Volts."</div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2025-03-17 06:44:35', '2025-03-17 07:01:07', 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'ART-PP-UTL-PWGN', 'ART-PP-UTL-PWGN', 'APP POWER GENERATION SYSTEM', NULL, NULL, 'APP POWER GENERATION SYSTEM', 'ART-PP', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
