 PSI.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Engine jacket water temperature TG-5721 = 91oC</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- PG-5723 = 3.10 BARG.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Discharge pressure PIT-5720 = 11.00 BAR."</div><div><br></div>', '<div>"As found Pyroban cartridge broken. Bring to hot work shop for re-welded.</div><div>Issued Noti#100658713 to ART-CSTR"</div><div><br></div>', '2025-03-17 09:57:36', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
