 oil pressure PG-5742 = 90 psi</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Engine jacket water temperature TG-5741 = 89oC</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- Seawater Pressure PG-5743 = 2.8 BARG.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; "</div><div><br></div>', '<div>"As found Pyroban cartridge broken. Bring to hot work shop for re-welded.</div><div>Issued Noti#100658713 to ART-CSTR"</div><div><br></div>', '2025-03-17 10:07:04', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'ART-PP-P5740.PK', 'ART-PP-P5740.PK', 'APP FIRE WATER PUMP NO2 PACKAGE', NULL, NULL, 'APP FIRE WATER PUMP NO2 PACKAGE', 'ART-PP', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
