r and measure data as follow.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Battery boost charging current after discharge = 35.8 Amps.</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - Battery boost charging voltage after discharge = 390.9 Volts."</div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2025-03-17 10:08:08', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL, false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'ART-QP-UTL-PWGN', 'ART-QP-UTL-PWGN', 'AQP POWER GENERATION SYSTEM', NULL, NULL, 'AQP POWER GENERATION SYSTEM', 'ART-QP', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
  INSERT INTO task_owner (report_id, name, email, type, created_date, updated_date, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (new_report_id, 'CONCOR', NULL, 'EXTERNAL', '2025-03-17 10:08:08', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\AthiwatK', NULL);
