gn="bottom">   <p align="left">&nbsp; 53,219 Hrs.</p>   </td>   <td width="24" colspan="2"><p>&nbsp;</p></td>  </tr>    <tr height="0">   <td width="67"></td>   <td width="55"></td>   <td width="82"></td>   <td width="139"></td>   <td width="113"></td>   <td width="16"></td>   <td width="12"></td>   <td width="74"></td>   <td width="56"></td>   <td width="65"></td>   <td width="12"></td>   <td width="12"></td>  </tr>   </tbody></table>  <p align="left"><b>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Suction Strainer</u></b></p><p align="left">Cleaning strainer. <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">(70% blocked)</span></p><p align="left">Visual strainer condition.</p><p align="left">Clean sealing surface on RTJ groove.</p><p align="left">Replace RTJ gasket R45D.</p><p align="left">Torque value: 597 ft-lb (809Nm)</p><p align="left"><b>2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Min flow check valve</u></b></p><p align="left">Cleaning.</p><p align="left">Visual check sealing surface on body and disc.<u></u></p><p align="left">Visual check mechanism.</p><p align="left">Replace new flapper spring.<u></u></p><p align="left">Clean sealing surface on RTJ groove.</p><p align="left">Replace RTJ R37D gasket.</p><p align="left">Ensure flow direction is correctly.</p><p align="left">Torque value: 597 ft-lb (809Nm)</p><p align="left"><b>3.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Discharge check valve</u></b></p><p align="left">Cleaning <u></u></p><p align="left">Visual check sealing surface on body and disc.</p><p align="left">Visual check mechanism. (good condition)</p><p align="left">Clean sealing surface on RTJ groove.</p><p align="left">Replace RTJ R45D gasket.</p><p align="left">Ensure flow direction is correctly.</p><p align="left">              </p><p align="left">Torque value: 597 ft-lb (809Nm)</p><p align="left"><b>4.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Lube oil bearing</u></b></p><p align="left">Lubrication: PTT Hydraulic 46</p><p align="left">Drain, flushing and check condition</p><p align="left">Replace bronze gasket (if necessary) </p><p align="left">DE Capacity: 0.82 liter</p><p align="left">          </p><p align="left">NDE Capacity: 0.77 liter</p><p align="left"><b>5.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Mechanical Seal</u></b></p><p align="left">Retighten mounting bolt.</p><p align="left">    </p><p align="left">No liquid seep or leaking.</p><p align="left"><b>6.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Barrier fluid system</u></b></p><p align="left">Check N2 Pre-charge pressure:</p><p align="left">DE= 7.0 Bars.</p><p align="left">NDE=7.0 Bars.</p><p align="left">Spec: 7.2 Bar.</p><p align="left">Check pressure/temperature gauge condition.</p><p align="left">          </p><p align="left">Check any leakage at flange joint/fin tube.</p><p align="left"><b>7.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Coupling</u></b></p><p align="left">Retighten bolt.</p><p align="left">Check condition of membrane element.</p><p align="left">      </p><p align="left">Remove rust and preserve.</p><p align="left"><b>8.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Alignment</u></b></p><p align="left">  </p><p align="left">Recheck alignment.</p><p align="left">Alignment value is in acceptable. No need to realignment.</p><p align="left"><b>9.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><b><u>Cleaning and Preserve package</u></b></p><p align="left">Remove corroded and rusty on structure and bolt nut.</p><p align="left">Preserve with grease/soft seal/Zing It</p><p align="left">      </p><p align="left">Cleaning with Oiler-1</p><p align="left"><b><u></u></b></p><div align="center"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="673"><tbody>  <tr>   <td width="673" colspan="2" valign="top">   <p align="center"><b><u>Test   Run</u></b></p>   <div align="center">   <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="564">    <tbody><tr>     <td width="226" colspan="2">     <p align="center">Description</p>     </td>     <td width="91">     <p align="center">Tag No.</p>     </td>     <td width="100" nowrap="">     <p align="center">Acceptance</p>     </td>     <td width="57" nowrap="">     <p align="center">Unit</p>     </td>     <td width="90" nowrap="">     <p align="center">Reading</p>     </td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td width="34" nowrap="" rowspan="3">     <p align="center"><br></p>     </td>     <td width="192" nowrap="">     <p align="left">Suction Pressure.</p>     </td>     <td width="91" nowrap="">     <p>2PI-50308</p>     </td>     <td width="100" nowrap=""></td>     <td width="57" nowrap="">     <p align="center">Bars</p>     </td>     <td width="90" nowrap="">     <p align="center">5.2</p>     </td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td width="192" nowrap="">     <p align="left">Discharge Pressure.</p>     </td>     <td width="91" nowrap="">     <p>2PI-50300</p>     </td>     <td width="100" nowrap=""></td>     <td width="57" nowrap="">     <p align="center">Bars</p>     </td>     <td width="90" nowrap="">     <p align="center">98.9</p>     </td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td width="192" nowrap="">     <p align="left"><span style="background-color: transparent;">Flow rate&nbsp; 60.6 m3/h.</span></p><p align="left">Balancing line press:&nbsp; 7.27 bar.</p>     </td>     <td width="91" nowrap="">     <p>&nbsp;</p>     </td>     <td width="100" nowrap="">     <p align="center">&nbsp;</p>     </td>     <td width="57" nowrap="">     <p align="center"><br></p></td><td width="90" nowrap="">     </td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td width="34" nowrap="" rowspan="4">     <p align="center"><br></p>     </td>     <td width="192" nowrap="">     <p align="left">DE</p><p align="left">Lube oil Level.</p>     </td>     <td width="91" nowrap="">     <p>&nbsp;</p>     </td>     <td width="100" nowrap="">     <p align="center">@ Half</p>     </td>     <td width="57" nowrap=""></td>     <td width="90" nowrap="">     <p align="center">OK</p>     </td>    </tr>    <tr>     <td width="192" nowrap="">     <p align="left">Fluid barrier pressure</p>     </td>     <td width="91" nowrap="">     <p