tion tested slew left / right, limit switch and override. (Proper function)&nbsp;</div><div>- Function tested slew lock. (Proper function)&nbsp;</div><div>- Function tested rotation crane smoothly. (Good condition)&nbsp;</div><div>- Function tested emergency stop at crane cabin and power pack. (Normal function)&nbsp;</div><div>- Function tested horn. (Proper function)&nbsp;</div><div>- Measured hooks throat opening main load block 160 mm. and auxiliary ball 105 mm.&nbsp;</div><div>- Function tested (load indicator) main and auxiliary with load 2.5 ton.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>&nbsp;</div>', NULL, '2025-03-28 18:13:00', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\DirekT', NULL, false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
  INSERT INTO tags (report_id, equipment_no, technical_id_no, technical_object_description, superior_functional_location, superior_equipment, text, location, children, created_date, updated_date) VALUES (new_report_id, 'GBS-2X-2373', 'GBS-2X-2373', 'Pedestal Crane Package for WPS13', NULL, NULL, 'Pedestal Crane Package for WPS13', 'GBS-WP13', false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
