g properly no leakage at body</p><p><br></p><p><i>**ESD Test complete and Platform start up normalize but keep status ESD2 by following CRO</i></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', NULL, '2025-04-02 11:12:25', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.Inst-Lead', NULL, false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
