EA. No. 6218.<br>- Installed shaft to bearing housing.<br>- Check Shaft end play check on the thrust bearing = 0.03 mm.<br>- Radial deflection check condition of bearing and their fit in the housing and on the shaft final = 0.03 mm.<br>- Installed hub to shaft heat at 120 c''</p><p>11/04/2025</p><p>- Installed mechanical seal cartridge assembly tightening four nuts at 50 Ft-lbs.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;Mechanical seal does not have gasket (GRAFOIL Ref: 34 = 2 EA.)&nbsp;Forming new gaskets using pure&nbsp; &nbsp;graphite</p><p>- Installed impeller and cap nut.</p><p>- Check leak mechanical seal outboard side at 1.5 bar before to install.<br>12/04/2025</p><p>- Transfer pump to APP Upper deck.</p><p>13/04/2025</p>- Installed pump to casing cover and&nbsp;tighten&nbsp;at 700 Ft-lbs.<p></p><p>- Perform mechanical De-Isolation.</p><p>14/04/2025<br>- Inspection membrane coupling good condition.</p><p>- Installed coupling and recorded.<br>&nbsp; DBSE. = 180.45 mm.<br>&nbsp; DBFF. = 180.20 mm.</p><p>- Clean sight glass of seal pot tank.<br>- Check cool alignment.</p><p>15/04/2025<br>- Check hot alignment at condition about 197 c''<br>- Recorded vibration.</p><p>- Test run pump normal.</p><p>- Pressure pump Suction = 4.5 bar Discharge = 10.96 Bar.&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p></p><p></p>', '- Mechanical seal does not have gasket (GRAFOIL Ref: No.34 = 2 EA.)&nbsp;Forming new gaskets using pure graphite', '2025-04-07 16:54:18', '2025-04-16 19:37:35', 'PTTEP\\art.mechcrane', 'PTTEP\\art.mechcrane', false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
